{"sha":"c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","node_id":"C_kwDOApqIINoAKGM1ZmQwOTdlNWNjZThiNDYxYzY0NDNhZjAyYjM0NDhiYWVmMjQ5MWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Martin Blix Grydeland","email":"martin@varnish-software.com","date":"2022-08-04T08:59:33Z"},"committer":{"name":"Martin Blix Grydeland","email":"martin@varnish-software.com","date":"2022-08-09T08:48:59Z"},"message":"Do not call http_hdr_flags() on pseudo-headers\n\nIn http_EstimateWS(), all headers are passed to the http_isfiltered()\nfunction to calculate how many bytes is needed to serialize the entire\nstruct http. http_isfiltered() will check the headers for whether they are\ngoing to be filtered out later and if so skip them.\n\nHowever http_isfiltered() would attempt to treat all elements of struct\nhttp as regular headers with an implicit structure. That does not hold for\nthe first three pseudo-header entries, which would lead to asserts in\nlater steps.\n\nThis patch skips the filter step for pseudo-headers.\n\nFixes: #3830","tree":{"sha":"0c01440e3e3e56a9b572a278aec11fab136041df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/git/trees/0c01440e3e3e56a9b572a278aec11fab136041df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/git/commits/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/commits/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","html_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/commit/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/commits/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d/comments","author":{"login":"mbgrydeland","id":661482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTQ4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/661482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland","html_url":"https://github.com/mbgrydeland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"mbgrydeland","id":661482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTQ4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/661482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland","html_url":"https://github.com/mbgrydeland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbgrydeland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4ef50851ddf700fe4fb6807375347b4d52d4ca47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/commits/4ef50851ddf700fe4fb6807375347b4d52d4ca47","html_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/commit/4ef50851ddf700fe4fb6807375347b4d52d4ca47"}],"stats":{"total":31,"additions":31,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"d48c0bb366fe49176aec5fc649761d3773161a8c","filename":"bin/varnishd/cache/cache_http.c","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/blob/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d/bin%2Fvarnishd%2Fcache%2Fcache_http.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/raw/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d/bin%2Fvarnishd%2Fcache%2Fcache_http.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/contents/bin%2Fvarnishd%2Fcache%2Fcache_http.c?ref=c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","patch":"@@ -1147,6 +1147,8 @@ http_isfiltered(const struct http *fm, unsigned u, unsigned how)\n \n \tif (fm->hdf[u] & HDF_FILTER)\n \t\treturn (1);\n+\tif (u < HTTP_HDR_FIRST)\n+\t\treturn (0);\n \te = strchr(fm->hd[u].b, ':');\n \tif (e == NULL)\n \t\treturn (0);"},{"sha":"5155981923c5091cd1f99eff66476c5a750ec42a","filename":"bin/varnishtest/tests/r03830.vtc","status":"added","additions":29,"deletions":0,"changes":29,"blob_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/blob/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d/bin%2Fvarnishtest%2Ftests%2Fr03830.vtc","raw_url":"https://github.com/varnishcache/varnish-cache/raw/c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d/bin%2Fvarnishtest%2Ftests%2Fr03830.vtc","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varnishcache/varnish-cache/contents/bin%2Fvarnishtest%2Ftests%2Fr03830.vtc?ref=c5fd097e5cce8b461c6443af02b3448baef2491d","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@\n+varnishtest \"3830: Do not call http_hdr_flags() on pseudo-headers\"\n+\n+server s1 {\n+\trxreq\n+\ttxresp -reason \":x\"\n+\n+\trxreq\n+\ttxresp\n+} -start\n+\n+varnish v1 -vcl+backend {\n+\tsub vcl_recv {\n+\t\treturn (hash);\n+\t}\n+} -start\n+\n+client c1 {\n+\ttxreq\n+\trxresp\n+\texpect resp.status == 200\n+} -run\n+\n+client c2 {\n+\ttxreq -url :x -method :x\n+\trxresp\n+\texpect resp.status == 200\n+} -run\n+\n+varnish v1 -vsl_catchup"}]}